{"id":"020d956e13f1fe78","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-exponential-sum.md","title":"Exponential Sum","display":"df-exponential-sum — Exponential Sum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-exponential-sum","aliases":["58-df-exponential-sum","Exponential Sum"],"display":"df-exponential-sum — Exponential Sum","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-exponential-sum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-exponential-sum</span><span>Exponential Sum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-exponential-sum — Exponential Sum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(x)\\coloneqq e^{2\\pi i x}\">\\(e(x)\\coloneqq e^{2\\pi i x}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(f:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(N;\\alpha)\">\\(S(N;\\alpha)\\)</span>（未加权线性指数和）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_f(N;\\alpha)\">\\(S_f(N;\\alpha)\\)</span>（系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的加权指数和）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\alpha\\|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dist}(\\alpha,\\mathbb Z)\">\\(\\|\\alpha\\|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dist}(\\alpha,\\mathbb Z)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}sum\\text{-}unweighted}\\vdash S(N; \\alpha)\\coloneqq \\sum_{n=1}^N e^{2\\pi i \\alpha n}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}sum\\text{-}unweighted}\\vdash S(N; \\alpha)\\coloneqq \\sum_{n=1}^N e^{2\\pi i \\alpha n}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}sum\\text{-}weighted}\\vdash S_f(N;\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n=1}^Nf(n)e(\\alpha n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}sum\\text{-}weighted}\\vdash S_f(N;\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n=1}^Nf(n)e(\\alpha n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(N;\\alpha)=N\">\\(S(N;\\alpha)=N\\)</span>，所以含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/\\|\\alpha\\|\">\\(1/\\|\\alpha\\|\\)</span> 的估计必须排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\alpha\\|=0\">\\(\\|\\alpha\\|=0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{2\\pi i\\alpha}\\neq1\">\\(e^{2\\pi i\\alpha}\\neq1\\)</span>，有限几何级数公式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(N;\\alpha)=\\frac{e^{2\\pi i\\alpha(N+1)}-e^{2\\pi i\\alpha}}{e^{2\\pi i\\alpha}-1}\">\\(S(N;\\alpha)=\\frac{e^{2\\pi i\\alpha(N+1)}-e^{2\\pi i\\alpha}}{e^{2\\pi i\\alpha}-1}\\)</span>；并有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\|\\alpha\\|\\leq\\tfrac12\\Rightarrow|S(N;\\alpha)|\\leq\\min(N,(2\\|\\alpha\\|)^{-1})\">\\(0&lt;\\|\\alpha\\|\\leq\\tfrac12\\Rightarrow|S(N;\\alpha)|\\leq\\min(N,(2\\|\\alpha\\|)^{-1})\\)</span>。这些是由定义推出的估计，不是定义子句。</li>\n<li>对多项式相位的 Weyl 型幂节省需要无理性或有理逼近等附加假设，不能无条件写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N^{1-\\delta}\">\\(N^{1-\\delta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Van der Corput 差分法和 Vinogradov 均值定理提供更一般指数和的估计。</li>\n<li>加权和必须保留频率参数；原记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_f(N)\">\\(S_f(N)\\)</span> 无法确定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vaughan, The Hardy-Littlewood Method</li>\n<li>Iwaniec, Topics in Classical Automorphic Forms</li>\n<li>Montgomery, Ten Lectures on the Interface</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"e(x)\\coloneqq e^{2\\pi i x}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"S(N;\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"S_f(N;\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\alpha\\|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dist}(\\alpha,\\mathbb Z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}sum\\text{-}unweighted}\\vdash S(N; \\alpha)\\coloneqq \\sum_{n=1}^N e^{2\\pi i \\alpha n}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}sum\\text{-}weighted}\\vdash S_f(N;\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n=1}^Nf(n)e(\\alpha n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"S(N;\\alpha)=N","display":false},{"tex":"1/\\|\\alpha\\|","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\alpha\\|=0","display":false},{"tex":"e^{2\\pi i\\alpha}\\neq1","display":false},{"tex":"S(N;\\alpha)=\\frac{e^{2\\pi i\\alpha(N+1)}-e^{2\\pi i\\alpha}}{e^{2\\pi i\\alpha}-1}","display":false},{"tex":"0<\\|\\alpha\\|\\leq\\tfrac12\\Rightarrow|S(N;\\alpha)|\\leq\\min(N,(2\\|\\alpha\\|)^{-1})","display":false},{"tex":"N^{1-\\delta}","display":false},{"tex":"S_f(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1716,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-504","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-exponential-sum.md|58-df-exponential-sum]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["5045d216c83e75cb"]}